# DEFINITION OF DONE
Builds clean on JDK 21 with tests passing; starts on all three profiles; authentication and API-call configuration is environment-driven and verified as far as possible; the UI files are unchanged and the UI starts; every issue is either fixed with evidence or explicitly listed as UNVERIFIED or needing a human decision. Do not claim completion otherwise.
